    "title": "Maryland ACA plan premiums will rise 14.6% next year - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WYPR - 88.1 FM Baltimore ,\n1 days ago Maryland ACA insurance premiums will increase by 14.6% next year. The Maryland Insurance Administration (MIA) approved the rates Friday. The increase is the second year in a row the state has seen substantial increases to premiums. Last year, premium rates increased 13.4%. The rates for 2027 are even higher than... Read full article\n8",
